    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d519">

                <pb facs="0733" n="627" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg627"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Lee to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guayaquil</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic">July 19,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith (in
                    duplicate) a résumé of a decree issued by the Government of Ecuador for the
                    purpose of <pb facs="0734" n="628" xml:id="pg628"/> fostering industries,
                    manufactures, agriculture, pisciculture, and other similar enterprises in the
                    Republic.</p>
                <p>This decree is looked upon by the people as a very important measure, and it is
                    hoped that ample results will follow.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Joseph W. J. Lee.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d519-a1.xml" xpointer="d519-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
